</section>

<!-- ============ 3. story ============ -->
<section class="story">
  <div class="wrap story__grid">
    <div class="story__shot">
      <img src="{{ 'hero-lifestyle.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A woman holding the pink multi balm stick against her cheek" width="1584" height="672">
    </div>
    <div class="story__text">
      <p class="kicker">Why we made this</p>
      <h2 class="h2">You were told to <em>start earlier</em>. Nobody said what to do now.</h2>
      <p>Every counter in the country will sell a woman in her forties a jar. Fifty millilitres, a name in French, a number on the front that means nothing. You take it home, you use it for three weeks, and the honest answer is that you cannot tell.</p>
      <p>So we went the other way. One format you will actually reach for, one active at a strength worth printing, and the whole list on the box where a person can read it without a magnifier.</p>
      <p>It is a balm because a balm survives a handbag. It is pink because the PDRN is, and we saw no reason to bleach it white and charge more for the privilege.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--fill" href="#pricing" data-pick="1">Shop the balm &middot; {{ m1 }}</a>
      <p class="fine">Free shipping. 30 day guarantee.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 4. benefits ============ -->
<section class="benefits" id="benefits">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker center">What it does</p>
    <h2 class="h2 center">Four things women actually<br>come to us for.</h2>
    <p class="lede center">Not a claim about your biology. A description of what the actives are known to support, and what women in them tell us they notice.</p>

    <ul class="quad">
      <li class="qcard">
        <span class="qcard__tag">Eyes</span>
        <h3 class="qcard__h">Crepe that catches the light</h3>
        <p>The thin skin under the eye is where dryness reads as age first. PDRN and hyaluronic acid hold water there, and the balm base stops it leaving.</p>
        <p class="qcard__fine">Supports the look of a smoother, better hydrated eye area.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="qcard">
        <span class="qcard__tag">Smile lines</span>
        <h3 class="qcard__h">The two you notice on video calls</h3>
        <p>Nasolabial folds are structural and no cream removes them. Softened and light reflecting is a different thing, and that part is achievable.</p>
        <p class="qcard__fine">Supports the appearance of softer, less shadowed folds.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="qcard">
        <span class="qcard__tag">Neck</span>
        <h3 class="qcard__h">The bit everyone forgets</h3>
        <p>Most women stop at the jaw because reaching for a second product is one step too many. A stick removes the excuse. Three upward passes.</p>
        <p class="qcard__fine">Supports hydration and barrier comfort on the neck and chest.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="qcard">
        <span class="qcard__tag">Lips</span>
        <h3 class="qcard__h">Not a lip balm, but it works</h3>
        <p>Same stick, straight across the lip line, where lipstick has started to travel. Ceramide and squalane do the sealing.</p>
        <p class="qcard__fine">Supports a smoother lip border and comfortable, conditioned lips.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="center"><a class="btn btn--fill" href="#pricing" data-pick="2">Start with two sticks &middot; {{ m2 }}</a>
    <p class="fine">Free shipping. 30 day guarantee.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

